# GitHub counts bytes when it detects languages, so the LaTeX sources would
# otherwise drown out the Python package that is the actual codebase. The
# thesis really is documentation, so mark it as such: the repository then
# reports Python, which is what you can run.
Sections/** linguist-documentation
*.tex linguist-documentation

# Binary assets: never try to merge or diff them as text.
*.pdf binary
*.jpg binary
*.png binary
